{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7e1f4c2-9a3d-4f6e-8c11-phase7issueflow",
    "name": "issueFlow Phase 7 API Suite",
    "description": "Phase 7 接口测试套件（菜单重构 / 基础设施菜单 / 来源·优先级字典 / 个人中心三 Tab）。\n\n运行前置：\n1. 变量 baseUrl 默认 http://10.55.3.23:18082/api，可在环境中覆盖。\n2. T1 登录会自动把 data.token 写入集合变量 token，后续用例统一使用 Bearer 鉴权。\n3. 注意 @RequestParam 参数名必须准确：侧边菜单是 `type`，字典选项是 `typeCode`，传错会返回 400/500。\n\n实跑观察（2026-07-31，非 Phase 7 阻塞项，仅记录）：\n- 缺失/写错必填 @RequestParam 时（如 GET /menus/sidebar 不带 type、GET /dicts/options?type=xxx），线上返回 `{code:500, message:\"系统错误\"}`，而非 400 参数校验错误。建议后续在全局异常处理器补 MissingServletRequestParameterException → 400 的映射（P2 健壮性优化，非本期缺陷）。\n- GET /dicts/options?typeCode=NOT_EXIST 返回 200 + 空数组，行为合理。\n- T6 脱敏取值断言在 admin 未绑定邮箱/手机时无数据可验证，脚本按 SKIP 处理；待有绑定数据的账号后补充验证。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://10.55.3.23:18082/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "username", "value": "admin", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "admin123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "T1 登录 - POST /auth/login",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// 断言：HTTP 200 / code=200 / data.token 非空，并写入集合变量供后续用例复用",
              "pm.test('T1-1 HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "var body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('T1-2 业务 code = 200', function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql(200); });",
              "pm.test('T1-3 data.token 非空', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(body.data).to.have.property('token');",
              "    pm.expect(body.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.to.have.length.above(0);",
              "});",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.data.token);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
        "description": "预期：200，data.token 非空字符串。"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "T2 管理后台侧边菜单 - GET /menus/sidebar?type=2",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// 断言：菜单树（任意层级）必须包含 Phase 7 要求的 8 个菜单名",
              "pm.test('T2-1 HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "var body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('T2-2 业务 code = 200', function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql(200); });",
              "",
              "function flatten(nodes, acc) {",
              "    (nodes || []).forEach(function (n) {",
              "        acc.push(n.name);",
              "        if (n.children && n.children.length) { flatten(n.children, acc); }",
              "    });",
              "    return acc;",
              "}",
              "var names = flatten(body.data, []);",
              "var required = ['业务管理', '基础设施', '字典配置', '文件管理', '文件列表', '配置管理', 'Redis监控', '定时任务'];",
              "required.forEach(function (name) {",
              "    pm.test('T2-3 菜单树包含【' + name + '】', function () {",
              "        pm.expect(names).to.include(name);",
              "    });",
              "});",
              "",
              "// 结构性断言：项目配置 / 模块配置 / 字典配置 必须挂在【业务管理】之下",
              "var biz = (body.data || []).filter(function (n) { return n.name === '业务管理'; })[0];",
              "pm.test('T2-4 业务管理下含 项目配置/模块配置/字典配置', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(biz, '业务管理一级菜单存在').to.be.an('object');",
              "    var kids = (biz.children || []).map(function (c) { return c.name; });",
              "    pm.expect(kids).to.include.members(['项目配置', '模块配置', '字典配置']);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// 结构性断言：文件配置/文件列表 挂在【文件管理】之下，文件管理挂在【基础设施】之下",
              "var infra = (body.data || []).filter(function (n) { return n.name === '基础设施'; })[0];",
              "pm.test('T2-5 基础设施 > 文件管理 > (文件配置, 文件列表)', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(infra, '基础设施一级菜单存在').to.be.an('object');",
              "    var fileMgr = (infra.children || []).filter(function (c) { return c.name === '文件管理'; })[0];",
              "    pm.expect(fileMgr, '文件管理存在于基础设施下').to.be.an('object');",
              "    var kids = (fileMgr.children || []).map(function (c) { return c.name; });",
              "    pm.expect(kids).to.include.members(['文件配置', '文件列表']);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/menus/sidebar?type=2",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["menus", "sidebar"],
          "query": [{ "key": "type", "value": "2", "description": "参数名必须是 type（后台菜单=2），传错会 400/500" }]
        },
        "description": "预期：200，菜单树含 业务管理/基础设施/字典配置/文件管理/文件列表/配置管理/Redis监控/定时任务。"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "T3 字典-来源 - GET /dicts/options?typeCode=ISSUE_SOURCE",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// 断言：200 / 共 5 项 / code 集合完全匹配",
              "pm.test('T3-1 HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "var body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('T3-2 业务 code = 200', function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql(200); });",
              "pm.test('T3-3 选项数量 = 5', function () { pm.expect(body.data).to.be.an('array').with.lengthOf(5); });",
              "var codes = (body.data || []).map(function (d) { return d.code; });",
              "pm.test('T3-4 含 SYSTEM/API_IMPORT/EXCEL_IMPORT/EMAIL/OTHER', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(codes).to.have.members(['SYSTEM', 'API_IMPORT', 'EXCEL_IMPORT', 'EMAIL', 'OTHER']);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('T3-5 选项均为启用态', function () {",
              "    (body.data || []).forEach(function (d) { pm.expect(d.enabled, d.code).to.eql(true); });",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/dicts/options?typeCode=ISSUE_SOURCE",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["dicts", "options"],
          "query": [{ "key": "typeCode", "value": "ISSUE_SOURCE", "description": "参数名必须是 typeCode" }]
        },
        "description": "预期：200，count=5，含 SYSTEM/API_IMPORT/EXCEL_IMPORT/EMAIL/OTHER。"
      }
    },
